sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 user
    participant H as 🖥️ host
    participant P as 🧩 plugin hooks
    participant M as 🤖 model
    participant T as 🧰 tools
    U->>H: a ticket
    H->>P: user_prompt
    P-->>H: level header<br/>(rules, if the level changed)
    loop one action per turn
        H->>P: pre_llm_call
        H->>M: one system message<br/>and the conversation
        M-->>H: notes and exactly one action
        H->>P: pre_tool: a gate may refuse
        alt refused
            P-->>H: the refusal and its reason
        else allowed
            H->>T: run it inside the fence
            T-->>H: the result
            H->>P: post_tool: may add a note
        end
        H->>M: the result, as the next message
    end
    M-->>H: done
    H-->>U: the change and<br/>a short answer
